":"Keyboard shortcut: Cmd+Shift+Space (macOS) / Ctrl+Shift+Space (other) to toggle ","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.709Z","version":1},"mem_mq6vxtdy_d82c6970c16b":{"concepts":[],"content":"TaskCard — draggable floating card showing task title, tags, notes, reminder timer. Uses framer-motion shake for attention. Close button triggers hide().","createdAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.727Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mq6vxtdy_d82c6970c16b","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"TaskCard — draggable floating card showing task title, tags, notes, reminder tim","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.727Z","version":1},"mem_mq6vxtef_c3743516089c":{"concepts":[],"content":"MainWindow (App.tsx) — main app with toolbar (view toggle, new card, close), renders either TaskView or WorkspacesView. Has custom titlebar with close/minimize.","createdAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.745Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mq6vxtef_c3743516089c","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"MainWindow (App.tsx) — main app with toolbar (view toggle, new card, close), ren","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.745Z","version":1},"mem_mq6vxtew_0576774ccac7":{"concepts":[],"content":"WorkspacesView — full-page grid of workspace cards, each showing icon, name, task count, dates. Has shiny +Workspace button.","createdAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.761Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mq6vxtew_0576774ccac7","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"WorkspacesView — full-page grid of workspace cards, each showing icon, name, tas","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.761Z","version":1},"mem_mq6vxtfd_df04ac1f7ce8":{"concepts":[],"content":"Toolbar — top bar with view toggle (Tasks/Workspaces), create new card button, close button.","createdAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.778Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mq6vxtfd_df04ac1f7ce8","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Toolbar — top bar with view toggle (Tasks/Workspaces), create new card button, c","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.778Z","version":1},"mem_mq6vxtfx_e780b197f305":{"concepts":[],"content":"Reminder system — each task has configurable reminder with interval (10s to 24h), pause state, shake animation.","createdAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.796Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mq6vxtfx_e780b197f305","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Reminder system — each task has configurable reminder with interval (10s to 24h)","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T16:59:53.796Z","version":1}}␀␀�}␀� ��